```json
{
  "claim": "agree",
  "action": "edit",
  "explanation": "The original implementation of `compact` only removed `None` values, while the documentation and example clearly indicated that all falsey values (including `0`, `''`, and `False`) should be removed. The edit restores the documented behavior.",
  "counterexample": {
    "args": [
      [
        "",
        1,
        0,
        true,
        false,
        null
      ]
    ],
    "expected": {
      "value": [
        1,
        true
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

